<title>ESTONIA: EESTI TELEFON TO ISSUE CPS WORTH 30 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>EESTI TELEFON TO ISSUE CPS WORTH 30 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eesti Telefon will issue commerical papers worth 30 million kroons on June 20 with a three-month maturity.</p>
<p>&quot;The issue matures on September 22 with a yield of 7.15 percent,&quot; Ulo Kallas manager of Hansapank's interest rate products department told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;These should sell well and there has never been a problem with telephone papers,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
